    <!-- Privacy -->
    <string name="privacy_text">Novka keeps everything on this phone. There is no account, no server, and no analytics.\n\nThe only thing Novka downloads is a list of exchange rates. Nothing about you or your money is sent with that request.\n\nWith notification access, Novka reads payment notifications from Google Wallet and Raiffeisen, and SMS notifications from Raiffeisen. Other notifications are ignored and never stored. One-time codes in bank messages are replaced with dots before the message is saved.\n\nBackups and CSV files are written only where you choose to save them. A backup without a password is not encrypted.\n\nDeleting the app deletes all of its data.</string>
